  "name": "PAWCon",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "PAWCon is an annual furry convention in San Jose, California, organized by the Pacific Anthropomorphics League. It was first held November 14 to 16, 2014, as Pacific Anthropomorphics Weekend, also known as PacAnthro, and was renamed PAWCon in 2017. It began at the San Jose Airport Garden Hotel and moved the next year to the DoubleTree San Jose, where Further Confusion was held until 2009, and it has had a party floor since 2015. Each year has a theme and a different animal-related charity, and attendance has grown from 213 to about 1,700.",
